WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.597
RUFUS: I'd gently note that Newsom
signing a law and Newsom understanding
the

00:00:03.597 --> 00:00:07.195
RUFUS: technical problem are not the
same event.

00:00:07.295 --> 00:00:11.575
JAMIE: Sure. But Coxon's words were
specific. He said the industry is
prioritizing

00:00:11.575 --> 00:00:15.855
JAMIE: competitive pressure over safety.
That's not a vague critique. That's a
named

00:00:15.855 --> 00:00:20.135
JAMIE: incentive failure.

00:00:20.235 --> 00:00:23.287
ALEX: And we still don't know whether
his resignation led to any internal

00:00:23.287 --> 00:00:26.338
ALEX: changes at Anthropic. We flagged
that yesterday as an open question, and

00:00:26.338 --> 00:00:29.390
ALEX: it is still open.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:33.924
RUFUS: Almost certainly still open.
Organizational safety culture does not
restructure itself in

00:00:33.924 --> 00:00:38.358
RUFUS: forty-eight hours because someone
left and told a journalist.
